      choices: ["many theatergoers and readers today are likely to find Shakespeare’s history plays less engaging than the tragedies.", "some of Shakespeare’s tragedies are more relevant to today’s audiences than twentieth-century plays.", "Romeo and Juliet is the most thematically accessible of all Shakespeare’s tragedies.", "experts in English history tend to prefer Shakespeare’s history plays to his other works."],
